            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Mactician Release Notes — 1.3.3

- Bundle TFT 18.4-5637330 (version code 8637330) for Global and Vietnam (VNG).
  An installed game is upgraded to it on the next launch without downloading the
  APKs again, and keeps its game data and Riot sign-in.
- The Global graphics optimization still covers only TFT 18.1 and 18.3, so 18.4
  runs on the standard rendering path.
- No other application changes.

Build 58 for Apple Silicon, macOS 12 or later. This build is signed ad hoc and
not notarized; open it through System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway.
]]></description>
